{"candidate_id":"figure-analysis:Figure6:2211b2970908b448","artifact_id":"Figure6","visual_type":"flowchart","description":"A flowchart depicting transformations on a directed acyclic graph intermediate representation (DAG IR). It shows forward and backward computation, communication operations, pipeline-parallel chunks, expert-parallel all-to-all operations, optimizer interaction, numbered transformations, and a bottom execution schedule partitioned across two device groups.","components":[{"name":"Optimizer","role":"optimizer component","visual_evidence":"A labeled box named Optimizer appears above the main graph with an arrow pointing toward the backward portion."},{"name":"F","role":"forward computation region","visual_evidence":"A green rounded rectangle labeled F appears in the upper computation bar."},{"name":"B","role":"backward computation region","visual_evidence":"A blue rounded rectangle labeled B appears beside F in the upper computation bar."},{"name":"PP_F","role":"pipeline-parallel forward chunk","visual_evidence":"A green rounded box labeled PP_F appears in the first row of graph nodes."},{"name":"s/r (forward)","role":"communication node","visual_evidence":"A small cornered box labeled s/r appears between PP_F and PP_1B."},{"name":"PP_1B","role":"pipeline-parallel backward chunk","visual_evidence":"A blue rounded box labeled PP_1B appears after the first s/r node."},{"name":"PP_B","role":"pipeline-parallel backward chunk","visual_evidence":"A blue rounded box labeled PP_B appears at the far right of the upper graph row."},{"name":"a2a chain","role":"expert-parallel communication sequence","visual_evidence":"A dashed enclosure contains repeated cornered boxes labeled a2a connected through blue intermediary nodes."},{"name":"EP_3","role":"expert-parallel chunk","visual_evidence":"A blue rounded box labeled EP_3 appears within the dashed expert-parallel sequence."},{"name":"EP_2","role":"expert-parallel chunk","visual_evidence":"A blue rounded box labeled EP_2 appears within the dashed expert-parallel sequence."},{"name":"ar","role":"all-reduce communication node","visual_evidence":"A cornered box labeled ar appears at the right end of the expert-parallel path."},{"name":"PP_0MB_1F","role":"pipeline and memory-buffer forward chunk","visual_evidence":"An orange rounded box labeled PP_0MB_1F appears in the lower transformation row."},{"name":"PP_1MB_1F","role":"pipeline and memory-buffer forward chunk","visual_evidence":"An orange rounded box labeled PP_1MB_1F appears in the lower transformation row."},{"name":"PP_1MB_1B","role":"pipeline and memory-buffer backward chunk","visual_evidence":"A purple rounded box labeled PP_1MB_1B appears in the lower transformation row."},{"name":"PP_0MB_1B","role":"pipeline and memory-buffer backward chunk","visual_evidence":"A purple rounded box labeled PP_0MB_1B appears at the right of the lower transformation row."},{"name":"Execution schedule","role":"device-partitioned execution order","visual_evidence":"A boxed schedule at the bottom is divided into rows for device=[0,1] and device=[2,3], with colored execution blocks arranged in time order."}],"relationships":[{"source_component":"F","relation":"precedes","target_component":"B"},{"source_component":"F","relation":"feeds","target_component":"PP_F"},{"source_component":"B","relation":"feeds","target_component":"PP_1B"},{"source_component":"PP_F","relation":"connects via communication to","target_component":"PP_1B"},{"source_component":"PP_1B","relation":"connects via communication to","target_component":"PP_B"},{"source_component":"PP_F","relation":"transforms into","target_component":"PP_0MB_1F"},{"source_component":"PP_1B","relation":"transforms into","target_component":"PP_1MB_1B"},{"source_component":"PP_B","relation":"transforms into","target_component":"PP_0MB_1B"},{"source_component":"EP_3","relation":"participates in","target_component":"a2a chain"},{"source_component":"EP_2","relation":"participates in","target_component":"a2a chain"},{"source_component":"Optimizer","relation":"receives from","target_component":"B"},{"source_component":"PP_0MB_1F","relation":"appears in","target_component":"Execution schedule"},{"source_component":"PP_1MB_1F","relation":"appears in","target_component":"Execution schedule"},{"source_component":"PP_1MB_1B","relation":"appears in","target_component":"Execution schedule"},{"source_component":"PP_0MB_1B","relation":"appears in","target_component":"Execution schedule"}],"findings":["The visual uses rounded boxes for computation chunks and cornered boxes for communication operations.","Thin arrows represent data dependencies, while wide arrows indicate transformations or scheduling directives.","The graph includes pipeline-parallel, expert-parallel, and memory-buffer-labeled stages.","The bottom schedule shows execution order across device=[0,1] and device=[2,3].","Numbered markers 1 through 5 identify transformations or stages in the depicted IR process."],"citations":[{"section_id":"sec-1~20","path_id":"1~20","quote":"Each rounded box is a Chunk. Boxes with corners are Comms. Thin arrows are data dependencies. Wide arrows are transforms corresponding to scheduling directives."},{"section_id":"sec-1~20","path_id":"1~20","quote":"The schedule at the bottom shows the execution order once all data dependencies specified by the model and temporal dependencies specified by Order have been applied."},{"section_id":"sec-1~7","path_id":"1~7","quote":"Nodes represent coarse-grained compute or communication units and data flows along edges."},{"section_id":"sec-1~7","path_id":"1~7","quote":"All communication is explicit in the graph."},{"section_id":"sec-1~9","path_id":"1~9","quote":"A placement directive that updates the device placement of matched nodes."}],"confidence":0.95,"provenance":{"image_sha256":"3483cc452446b7c9c4ed232e9848ba9d8b090cb84a997296f9469addb310201e","context_sha256":"d32fa1bf9db550bf8397f29b47d6b596dc29020f41922fff75d893815dc599d8","route_id":"figure-qa-luna","protocol":"openai_chat_completions","requested_model":"cx/gpt-5.6-luna","resolved_model":"cx/gpt-5.6-luna","prompt_sha256":"4786e6f3681b05b0e475e188f0fbd61e98def58906b98ae8010b07dfd44df596","output_schema_sha256":"ce01a5a23e7881cf450e76df819196e554730dbbea77c8ec1cf7e93a2dc11753","schema_id":"diagram_analysis","stage1_visual_type":"flowchart","prompt_task_sha256":"1dd7985b1567eda8d66c3da3478eab188eb6764f7e1445eb1b1014b72ad08dd6","route_policy_sha256":"897498afc82f7598dc9ebd6687dba16a821e18722262df3e299e45136eed1940","model_binding_sha256":"01208a249b295331443fdc61a0e35c1fe80cfdaea164f7a8d95c94b82517f43c","input_sha256":"7f816ef4096af0a4932da049aec279d35fb0ec72c90330cf8e31c3ff8081fbd3","output_sha256":"321156ea41dd34b7e50613b2681c19dd0cd93a84375f7f247819b334a9996b7d","input_tokens":2956,"output_tokens":1287,"latency_ms":24897},"typed_payload":null,"authoritative":false,"import_eligible":false}